)-11\\lambda +36] & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the auxiliary equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lambda (\\lambda -1)-11\\lambda +36 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-12\\lambda +36 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -6)^{2} & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we have a double root $\\lambda =6.$\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\ny(x)={c}_{1}{x}^{6}+{c}_{2}{x}^{6}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14073391/state.json" "file_sha256" "42b22848edc15a7dfcbbabf65b48a998d0cfad61ac6803d593095eb391abe549"} {"question" "q-102348" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14073391/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "4b681f72f3d9b84dbfec627fae1f034ff36ef5c5c491642156b4324c327d50b2"} {"question" "q-102348" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14073391/state.json" "file_sha256" "42b22848edc15a7dfcbbabf65b48a998d0cfad61ac6803d593095eb391abe549"} {"question" "q-102348" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "y(x)={c}_{1}{x}^{-4}+{c}_{2}{x}^{9}"] ["math" "y(x)={c}_{1}{x}^{-6}+{c}_{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x"] ["math" "y(x)={c}_{1}{x}^{-6}+{c}_{2}{x}^{6}"] ["math" "y(x)={c}_{1}{x}^{6}+{c}_{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x"] ["math" "y(x)={c}_{1}{x}^{6}+{c}_{2}{x}^{6}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14073391/state.json" "file_sha256" "42b22848edc15a7dfcbbabf65b48a998d0cfad61ac6803d593095eb391abe549"} {"question" "q-102348" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:ans